      <Comment source="pmngroup">This protein was shown to catalyse the oxidation of a number of diamine and polyamine substrates in the presence of dioxygen, leading to the release of H&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;O&lt;sub&gt;2&lt;/sub&gt;. The enzyme was expressed in an insect cells heterologous system. Cell extracts were used as assay source. The enzyme was not purified and no enzymatic information is currently available.</Comment>
